            "Q1 2025", "Funding"),
        new("r2", "Mar 8", "Alpha shipped to testers",
            "Core product deployed to 30 internal testers. Bug bounty program launched.",
            "Q1 2025", "Product"),
        new("r3", "May 22", "First paying customer",
            "Acme Corp signed annual contract at $24K ARR. Case study published.",
            "Q2 2025", "Revenue"),
        new("r4", "Jul 1", "Team grew to 12",
